**BRAND NAMING:**
brightplace is ALWAYS lowercase. No exceptions. Even at the start of a sentence. If brightplace begins a sentence, restructure the sentence so it does not start with the brand name rather than capitalizing it.

**PUNCTUATION:**
NEVER use em dashes (-- or the unicode character —). Use commas, periods, semicolons, colons, or parentheses in all cases where an em dash might otherwise appear.

**BANNED WORD:**
NEVER use the word "signal" in any form (signal, signaling, signals, signaled). Alternatives: "indicator," "suggests," "points to," "reflects."

